    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.poster.avif?t=1754413841\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.webm?t=1754413841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.mp4?t=1754413841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where your last job as an <strong>internet detective -</strong>\u00a0digging up dirt for a girl - bring you a <strong>gift (or curse?)</strong>: seeing girls in their <strong>animal forms</strong>.<br>Sometimes, it happens in your <strong>most intimate moments</strong>, blurring the lines between love and instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices shape the story</strong>\u2014embrace your wild side or fight to stay human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, you meet <strong>a girl with no animal form at all</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/13e87b6991409dd9483bebd4d6980fcd.avif?t=1754413841\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fully Animated NSFW Scenes</strong> \u2013 Juicy <strong>3D</strong> encounters, whether <strong>human or furry</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Fluid Animations &amp; Voiced Scenes</strong> \u2013 Every movement, every moan\u2014brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Several\u00a0Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices determine <strong>who you become and who you love</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></i> By smacking that WISHLIST button, you're casting a mega-mojo spell on our dev team, boosting their motivation by +1000 to whip up more juicy scenes and fluffy adventures just for you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on Twitter (yeah, Twitter, we just need to be sure you're old enough to understand\u00a0<strong>where to go</strong>) for all the juicy updates and <strong>behind-the-scenes goodies</strong>. Your feedback there helps us shape the story into something even more wild and wonderful! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.poster.avif?t=1754413841\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.webm?t=1754413841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/1f2ce60708ee271e492724a2419fd33f.mp4?t=1754413841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where your last job as an <strong>internet detective -</strong>\u00a0digging up dirt for a girl - bring you a <strong>gift (or curse?)</strong>: seeing girls in their <strong>animal forms</strong>.<br>Sometimes, it happens in your <strong>most intimate moments</strong>, blurring the lines between love and instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices shape the story</strong>\u2014embrace your wild side or fight to stay human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, you meet <strong>a girl with no animal form at all</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843920/extras/13e87b6991409dd9483bebd4d6980fcd.avif?t=1754413841\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fully Animated NSFW Scenes</strong> \u2013 Juicy <strong>3D</strong> encounters, whether <strong>human or furry</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Fluid Animations &amp; Voiced Scenes</strong> \u2013 Every movement, every moan\u2014brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Several\u00a0Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices determine <strong>who you become and who you love</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></i> By smacking that WISHLIST button, you're casting a mega-mojo spell on our dev team, boosting their motivation by +1000 to whip up more juicy scenes and fluffy adventures just for you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on Twitter (yeah, Twitter, we just need to be sure you're old enough to understand\u00a0<strong>where to go</strong>) for all the juicy updates and <strong>behind-the-scenes goodies</strong>. Your feedback there helps us shape the story into something even more wild and wonderful! </p>",
